  "primaryText": "MasterBox MB600L V2 Mid Tower PC Case\nSkip to main content\nSkip to footer content\nFeatured Campaigns\nFeatured Campaigns\nFreeform 2.0\nFreeForm 2.0 is our blueprint for Custom. Open. Personal. hardware. Shared mounting points, open-source files, and plug-and-play modules give you full control to upgrade, tweak, and showcase your rig without starting over.\nFreeform 2.0\nThermal Excellence\nThermal Excellence is Cooler Master’s commitment to redefining the boundaries of cooling technology through continuous innovation, research, and engineering precision. This initiative represents the culmination of decades of thermal R&D — driven by our philosophy of empowering builders.\nThermal Excellence\nComputex 2026\nComputex brings together the technologies shaping tomorrow’s computing landscape.\nThis year, Cooler Master is opening its Taipei headquarters to showcase the cooling innovations powering the next generation of high-performance systems.\nComputex 2026\nIndustry and Technology\nIndustry Technology\nSmart Manufacturing\nData Center Cooling\nLiquid-to-Liquid\n100 kW CDU\n120 kW CDU\n1400 kW CDU\n2500 kW CDU\nLiquid-to-Air\n25 kW CDU\n30 kW CDU\n75 kW CDU\n300 kW  CDU\nAquagate Max Retro Mini CDU\nCommissioning Tools\nFeeder Kit\nLoop Charge Kit\nMini-Charge Tool\nVacuum Nitrogen Charging System\nColdplate\nDIMM Coldplate\nGPU/CPU Coldplate\nHose Kit\nWall Manifold\nProducts\nConsumer Electronics\nPersonas\nCooling\nCase Fans\nAir Cooling\nStandard Cooler\nLiquid Cooling\nLaptop Cooling\nPhone Cooler\nThermal Paste\nPC Cases\nFull Tower\nMid Tower\nMini Tower\nPC Case Accessories\nPower Supplies\nX Series\nV Series\nV SFX Series\nMWE Series\nElite Series\nGX Series\nAccessories\nAudio\nControllers\nKeyboard\nMice\nMonitors\nMouse pads\nFurniture\nAccessories\nChairs\nDesk\nMasterHUB\nMAX\nATX\nMini ITX\nSystems\nImmersive Experience\nMASTERFRAME 360\nPremium modular ATX case\nExplore more\nFirst Time Builder\nFirst Time Builder\nThe Next Gen Gam